* ============================================================
* PROVISIONAL BJT model for Lab 04 preparation ONLY.
*
* This is a commonly circulated SPICE model for a 2N3904 NPN.
* It is NOT an instructor-verified Starter Kit model and must be
* replaced before submission when the real model/parameters arrive.
*
* Why keep it at all: it makes the netlist runnable today so that
* the Flask adapter, parser and plots can be developed and tested.
* Record the exact model name and source in docs/validation.md.
* ============================================================

.model Q2N3904 NPN(
+ Is=6.734f Xti=3 Eg=1.11
+ Vaf=74.03 Bf=416.4 Ne=1.259 Ise=6.734f
+ Ikf=66.78m Xtb=1.5 Br=0.7371 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0
+ Rc=1 Cjc=3.638p Mjc=0.3085 Vjc=0.75 Fc=0.5
+ Cje=4.493p Mje=0.2593 Vje=0.75
+ Tr=239.5n Tf=301.2p Itf=0.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=2 Rb=10
+)
